; Location prepositions: 5 phrase codes (bit 7 set)
;
; Index = (location flags AND $0E)/2: outside, inside, in, on, at. Read at
; $963C, copied into the message at $AFFC.
@label=LocationPrepositions
@keep
b$BA80 DEFW $84C2
@keep
 $BA82 DEFW $837B
@keep
 $BA84 DEFW $8378
@keep
 $BA86 DEFW $84AA
@keep
 $BA88 DEFW $8070
